<title>AI持续攻克未解数学难题，数学家们心情复杂</title>
<link>https://the-decoder.com/ai-keeps-cracking-unsolved-math-problems-and-mathematicians-have-mixed-feelings/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://the-decoder.com/?p=38472</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 16:01:31 +0000</pubDate>
<source>the-decoder.com</source>
<description><![CDATA[【the-decoder.com】OpenAI对单位距离猜想的反驳引发了数学领域一波AI辅助的进展。菲尔兹奖得主蒂莫西·高尔斯表示，GPT 5.6 Pro首次尝试就解决了他花费大量时间研究的两道难题。他警告说，如果数学家停止构建理解此类结果所需的专业知识，可能会导致“数学文化的毁灭”。其他人则简单地将AI视为生产力工具。文章《AI keeps cracking unsolved math problems, and mathematicians have mixed feelings》最初发表于The Decoder。<br/><br/><a href="https://the-decoder.com/ai-keeps-cracking-unsolved-math-problems-and-mathematicians-have-mixed-feelings/">阅读原文</a>]]></description>
</item>
