<link>https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/07/30/polyai-releases-dialog-rsn-1-an-audio-native-dialog-model-that-fuses-turn-taking-speech-recognition-function-calling-and-response/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.marktechpost.com/?p=81457</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 05:06:43 +0000</pubDate>
